1
00:00:43,120 --> 00:00:44,840
If it weren't for the approaching nightfall

2
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:46,680
I wouldn't have bothered saving you

3
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:54,360
Seventh Brother

4
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:56,320
Are you feeling better now?

5
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:10,640
You saved me

6
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:17,680
Consider this my way of repaying your kindness

7
00:01:20,840 --> 00:01:21,640
What do you mean?

8
00:01:23,800 --> 00:01:28,040
Years ago, the Third Prince used golden creeper to treat my snake venom

9
00:01:28,360 --> 00:01:31,280
He cared for me with noble principles

10
00:01:32,280 --> 00:01:33,560
That's why I fell in love with him

11
00:01:34,440 --> 00:01:36,320
But why doesn't he recognize me today

12
00:01:36,320 --> 00:01:37,160
While you do?

13
00:01:38,600 --> 00:01:39,200
I...

14
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:39,880
I...

15
00:01:39,880 --> 00:01:41,360
How much longer will you keep deceiving me?

16
00:01:45,480 --> 00:01:47,240
It was clearly you who saved me

17
00:01:47,600 --> 00:01:49,480
And you who took care of me

18
00:01:49,960 --> 00:01:50,760
Zhu Huaijin

19
00:01:51,360 --> 00:01:54,280
Why did you give all the credit to Zhu Huaichen?

20
00:01:56,600 --> 00:01:58,520
I always thought he was the one who changed

21
00:01:59,760 --> 00:02:00,520
But in truth...

22
00:02:01,600 --> 00:02:03,120
It turns out it was never him

23
00:02:05,520 --> 00:02:07,200
Zhi'an, I'm sorry

24
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:08,400
Why on earth did you do this

25
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:16,600
I don't have any reasonable explanation

26
00:02:18,160 --> 00:02:19,000
But there are some things

27
00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:21,800
I really shouldn't keep from you anymore

28
00:02:22,920 --> 00:02:24,040
If that day

29
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:27,480
I hadn't witnessed him killing his mother

30
00:02:28,880 --> 00:02:29,840
My destiny

31
00:02:30,760 --> 00:02:32,480
might have taken a completely different path

32
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:35,400
But if that were the case

33
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:38,040
I would never have met you

34
00:02:38,480 --> 00:02:39,680
So I have no regrets

35
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:41,720
Later on

36
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:46,120
I was controlled by Zhu Huaichen using Five Minerals Powder

37
00:02:46,720 --> 00:02:47,640
and became his pawn

38
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:52,120
When I first met you

39
00:02:53,720 --> 00:02:55,200
you were like a beam of light

40
00:02:56,040 --> 00:02:57,480
shining into my life

41
00:02:58,760 --> 00:03:00,640
I respect you, I love you

42
00:03:01,520 --> 00:03:03,400
For you, I'm willing to do anything

43
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:05,800
But later on

44
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:10,280
I ended up helping Zhu Huaichen hurt you

45
00:03:13,120 --> 00:03:15,280
The incident where you were blinded by the venomous snake

46
00:03:16,040 --> 00:03:17,000
was no accident

47
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:20,800
It was all Zhu Huaichen's scheme

48
00:03:22,720 --> 00:03:23,360
And I

49
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:27,160
was his accomplice

50
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:33,960
I'm not worthy of your love

51
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:38,840
I just wanted to stay by your side

52
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:41,600
to atone for my sins

53
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:45,880
Zhu Huaichen is narrow-minded

54
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:47,760
That's why he resents you

55
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:52,000
After using me to deceive your feelings

56
00:03:52,920 --> 00:03:54,600
he deliberately left me by your side

57
00:03:56,600 --> 00:03:57,720
So his real goal

58
00:03:58,840 --> 00:03:59,680
was the Dragon Jade

59
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:01,880
Yes

60
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:06,040
But I would never help him obtain the Dragon Jade's whereabouts

61
00:04:08,200 --> 00:04:09,520
My presence by your side

62
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:10,720
was only to protect you

63
00:04:13,320 --> 00:04:14,120
Zhi An

64
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:16,080
You can trust me

65
00:04:17,880 --> 00:04:19,760
Someone who deceived me for so long

66
00:04:20,400 --> 00:04:21,880
Still expects me to believe you

67
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:23,840
Zhu Huaijin

68
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:27,480
Is this all you've been hiding from me?

69
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:29,680
There's nothing else

70
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:33,440
I

71
00:04:34,440 --> 00:04:35,240
have

72
00:04:36,200 --> 00:04:37,760
The secret of my rebirth

73
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:40,320
My desperate struggle all this way

74
00:04:41,360 --> 00:04:45,200
And those people from the Li family slaughtered by Zhu Huaichen

75
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:48,320
How could I possibly tell you these things?

76
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:53,320
Zhi'an, I...

77
00:05:08,640 --> 00:05:10,120
I believe you have feelings for me

78
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:13,120
But I don't believe you won't hurt me

79
00:05:15,840 --> 00:05:17,000
I can't afford to lose

80
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:38,800
Miss

81
00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:42,840
This is the token of the princess's old acquaintance, General Xiao

82
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:45,120
Please deliver it to the princess for me

83
00:05:45,280 --> 00:05:48,040
Tell her Li Zhi'an has urgent matters to discuss

84
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:49,920
Alright, please wait a moment

85
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:58,000
Fortunately I came prepared

86
00:05:58,400 --> 00:06:00,920
The princess will surely see me with this token

87
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:10,360
Zhi An

88
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:17,720
Zhi An

89
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:19,960
Zhi An

90
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:21,720
Zhi An

91
00:06:30,040 --> 00:06:31,720
The princess says she's tired today

92
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:33,440
I notice you seem to have eye trouble

93
00:06:33,440 --> 00:06:34,880
Traveling through these mountains must be difficult for you

94
00:06:34,880 --> 00:06:36,240
Let this servant escort you down the mountain

95
00:06:37,480 --> 00:06:39,760
Why? This token...

96
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:41,520
Your Excellency, please make an exception

97
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:43,160
She came here with me

98
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:46,160
You left in such a hurry

99
00:06:46,160 --> 00:06:47,160
Why didn't you wait for me?

100
00:06:48,880 --> 00:06:50,720
So this distinguished guest is with the Seventh Prince

101
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:52,200
Please follow me

102
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:58,720
How did you make it here alone in these deep mountains?

103
00:06:58,960 --> 00:07:00,120
What if you had encountered danger?

104
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:03,680
Are you abandoning me?

105
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:07,840
Seventh Prince, please maintain proper decorum

106
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:11,640
Since you can meet Princess Jinghe whenever you wish with your far-reaching influence

107
00:07:11,640 --> 00:07:13,840
Why lower yourself

108
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:16,080
To play the role of your own enemy by my side?

109
00:07:17,400 --> 00:07:17,960
I...

110
00:07:18,080 --> 00:07:18,840
This way please, both of you

111
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:36,240
Greetings to Your Highness

112
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:41,760
So you're the woman who came with Xiao Lang's token
